  "ai.orion81Builds": "I-Orion-81 yakhelwe esofthiwini levulekile lebhalwe bantfu. Ibhalwe lapha ngobe ayentiwanga nge-AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>I-Orion-81 ngumsebenti lowentiwe ngalokuphelele nge-AI.<\/0> Onkhe umgca wekhodi ye-Orion-81 ngekwayo ubhalwe nge-Claude Code, ukhonjiswe ngumsunguli. Onkhe umkhumbi, limephu, ithekisitsi nemsindvo kukhiqizwe ngetinsita lebetibhalwe yi-Claude Code. Umsunguli unquma lokufanele kwakhiwe; i-Claude Code iyakhomba kutsi kwakhiwa njani. Imitapho levulekile lesekelwe kuyo ibhalwe ngaphansi kwa-'Lokungentiwanga nge-AI'. Sinye sento sisavuliwe futsi sibonakaliswa ngalokucacile: <1>kuhlolwa kwelayisense<\/1> yekhodi yemdlalo lelatfolwa ephrotofayipini ye-GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "I-Orion yacala ngomhla wa-28 Inyoni 2026 njengephrotofayipi enjini levulekile ye-Quake III Arena (GPL), imikhumbi ye-Elite Dangerous iyinkhuthazo yayo. Ngelilanga lesibili likhodi yemdlalo yadlulela ku-BuB, injini lensha lebhalwe nge-Claude Code; emamojula emdlalo avela ephrotofayipini futsi aphindze atfolwa emagama lamasha. Inguqulo 0.3.0 yanika tonkhe tinhlobo letingu-16 temikhumbi emitimba lemisha yato. Kuhlolwa kwekuhambisana nelayisense kuyahlola kutsi ngabe likhodi lelitsite lisavela yini ku-GPL yasekuqaleni, nekutsi ngabe tinhlelo tekucala temikhumbi tifana kakhulu yini nenkhuthazo yato. Kuhlolwa ngekushesha kwekufana kwekhodi nemthombo wephrotofayipi ye-GPL kwentiwe ngomhla wa-8 iMphala 2026, futsi kubuyeketwa kwalokutfolakele ngochwepheshe kuyaqhubeka. Konkhe lokutfolwa kuvela kwenye kutawubhalwa kabusha nobe kuklanywe kabusha.",
