  "d.10azxrl": "Emahlangotsi lamatsatfu elilanga ngetulu kwe-photosphere. Umthunzi ungumphilo: sihlangu sesisekelo, inkhwezi lenemsila, imitimba lemikhulu. Kuphuma kwemlilo kuta njalo ngemva kwemizuzu lemibalwa.",
