  "economy.todayHead": "Lokukhona lamuhla",
  "economy.todayLead": "Emazinga emtimba nesihlangu nemibala yesihlangu kusikrini se-LOADOUT (0.6.0) kukhombisa luhlobo lwekuthuthukiswa netihlobiso umnotfo lohlosiwe kutinika.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Ngobe imali lewutfolako ihlosiwe kubakhokhela. Umdlalo ucala wentiwe yi-AI ngalokuphelele kuze ukhone kuba khona nakancane; bakhi bemifanekiso labakhokhelwako bese bangena esikhundleni semsebenti we-AI, bakhonjiswe ngemagama.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ngingadlala ku-inthanethi yini?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Ingadlalwa mahhala yini?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Imibuto",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Akukabi njalo. Kudlala nabanye nge-LAN kunethiwekhi yinye kuyasebenta lamuhla (kusukela ku-0.2.0); kudlala ku-inthanethi akukakhiwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Iphrotofayipi yakhiwa enjinini levulekile ye-Quake III Arena (GPL) futsi yatsatsa imikhumbi ye-Elite Dangerous njengenkhuthazo. Ngelilanga lesibili likhodi yemdlalo yadlulela ku-BuB, injini lensha lebhalwe nge-Claude Code; emamojula emdlalo avela ephrotofayipini futsi aphindze atfolwa emagama lamasha. Inguqulo 0.3.0 yanika tonkhe tinhlobo letingu-16 temikhumbi emitimba lemisha. Kuhlolwa kwekuhambisana nelayisense kuyahlola kutsi ngabe likhodi lelitsite lisavela yini ku-GPL yasekuqaleni nekutsi ngabe tinhlelo tekucala temikhumbi tifana kakhulu yini nenkhuthazo yato. Kuhlolwa ngekushesha kwekufana kwekhodi nemthombo wephrotofayipi ye-GPL kwentiwe ngomhla wa-<0/>, futsi kubuyeketwa kwalokutfolakele ngochwepheshe kuyaqhubeka. Konkhe lokutfolwa kuvela kwenye kutawubhalwa kabusha nobe kuklanywe kabusha. Kuze kuphele kuhlolwa, asitsi impendvulo ithi cha.",
  "faq.questions": "Imibuto",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Imikhumbi, bugcisa, sixhumi nalokunye, njengoba imali ivumela. <0>Libhuku lelikhasi<\/0> libala sento ngasinye futsi litakhombisa lokungena esikhundleni ngalunye nemdizayini walo.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Imikhumbi nekuthuthukiswa kuhlelelwe kutsi kutfolakale ngekudlala nobe kuthengwe. Indlela imikhumbi lekhokhelwako lehlala ilunge ngayo ekulweni kwabadlali nabadlali isasaklanywa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Lelo licebo: kudlalwa mahhala ngemali yasemdlalweni lekhetsekako netihlobiso. Akukakhiwa.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ngabe umsebenti wemuntfu kukhona lokukopishiwe yini?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Iphuma nini, futsi kusiphi sisetjenziswa?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Tiphi tincenye lebantfu bangena esikhundleni sato, futsi ngitawati njani?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Kungani umdlalo lowentiwe yi-AI utawusita bakhi bemifanekiso?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Kutawudzinga kukhokha kuze unqobe yini?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Kute lilanga lekuphuma futsi kute intsengo kuze kube manje.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "I-Anthropic, i-Claude ne-Claude Code ngetimaka te-Anthropic, PBC. I-Unreal Engine ne-Epic Games ngetimaka te-Epic Games, Inc. I-Blender ngumaka we-Blender Foundation. I-Quake III Arena ne-Elite Dangerous ngetimaka tabanikati babo. Onkhe emagama angawabanikati bawo futsi asetjentiswa kuphela kukhomba tikhicitwa letibhekiselwe kuto. I-Orion-81 ayihlangene, ayisekelwa nobe ayivunyelwa nguloyo nobe loyo wato.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Lokufiswako. Akukho kuhlanganyela, kuhlobana nobe kuvunywa lokukhona.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Isiteshi siyeta",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Libhuku lekutfutfukisa ku-YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Landzela i-Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Bahlanganyeli bekutawuta?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Kute tilandzeli. Kute emakhukhi. Lisayithi lekubukwa kwangaphambili. Lonkhe liciniso lilandzelwa ekugcineni kweprojekthi; akukho lokusalapha lokungumnikelo nobe sethembiso.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ayikaphili",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Sinye sento sisavuliwe: <0>kuhlolwa kwelayisense<\/0> yekhodi yemdlalo lelatfolwa ephrotofayipini ye-GPL. Kusikeniswa kwekufana kwekhodi nemthombo wephrotofayipi kwentiwe ngomhla wa-<1/>, futsi kubuyeketwa kwalokutfolakele ngochwepheshe kuyaqhubeka.",
